 is the trivial path. Pruning cuts only subtrees with no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"solution (an unvisited vertex unreachable, or left without a usable predecessor or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"successor), so it keeps the order. Without a start the search is run again from each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"vertex in turn until one succeeds, so a graph with no Hamiltonian path costs n searches.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/tours\/graphprotocols\/directedgraph\/hamiltonianpath()","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"hamiltonianPath"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Path","preciseIdentifier":"s:5Walks4PathV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Vertex","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P6VertexQa"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Edges","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols08DirectedA0P5EdgesQa"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Index","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa"},{"kind":"text","text":">?"}]},"doc://Tours/documentation/Tours/GraphProtocols/DirectedGraph/hamiltonianPath(from:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Tours\/documentation\/Tours\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph\/hamiltonianPath(from:)","url":"\/documentation\/tours\/graphprotocols\/directedgraph\/hamiltonianpath(from:)","title":"hamiltonianPath(from:)","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"hamiltonianPath"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"from"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Vertex","precise